Task 14: Git Soft Reset

Identified the commit containing only the Item ID field and performed:

git reset --soft 0902328




Task 15: Recommit UUID and Hash Changes

The staged changes were recommitted:

git commit -m "Recommit Item UUID and Item Hash changes"






Task 16: Rebase master_1 onto Updated Main

Performed:

git rebase main master_1

A conflict occurred in:

templates/todo.html

The conflict was resolved, then:

git add templates/todo.html
git rebase --continue

The rebase completed successfully